          "settings": {
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>Once you’re qualified, we don’t leave you hanging. As one of the UK’s top-rated training providers, we’ve built <a href=\"/pages/associations-and-partners\" title=\"Associations and Partners\">partnerships with leading gyms</a> across the country — including The Gym Group, Virgin Active, and more.</p><p>That means every learner gets access to guaranteed job interviews, giving you a clear pathway into paid work. Whether you want to go employed or self-employed, we’ll help you hit the ground running.</p><p>You’ll also get ongoing career support, free business start-up resources, and 20 CPD units to expand your skills and boost your earning potential.<br/></p>",
            "link_label": "",
