        },
        "column_eDTUht": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>Want a career that pays well, fits around your life, and doesn’t require a university degree? Becoming a Wellness Personal Trainer opens the door to flexible, rewarding jobs that keep you active, fulfilled, and in control of your time.</p><p>These roles are in high demand - and for good reason. You get to help others improve their health and confidence while building a career that works on your terms.</p><p>Whether you want to work in gyms, run sessions in the community, coach clients online, or build your own wellness brand, it all starts here.</p>",
